-- one collision refutes injectivity, and with it every inference from digest equality to identity.
-- The digest remains sound, and sound is all it is: this is the whole of what a registry number, a
-- canonical SMILES or an InChIKey carries, and the field reads identity out of it anyway.
collision-not-injective : (D : Type 0) → (d : Mol → D) → Collision D d → (DigestInjective D d → Empty)
collision-not-injective D d c = λ inj → snd (snd (snd c)) (inj (fst c) (fst (snd c)) (fst (snd (snd c))))
